@startuml approachB-sequence
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title Query-side reporting
caption Proposed approach B — not implemented
participant "Reporting use case" as S
participant "Query adapter" as Q
participant "Database" as D
participant "Quote port" as P
S -> Q: Request metrics for portfolio
Q -> D: Aggregate history and holding state
note over D
Define row grain, numeric precision
and rounding; verify the query plan.
end note
D --> Q: K ticker rows
Q --> S: Query result
S -> P: Request quotes
P --> S: Quote map
S -> S: Assemble the defined report
note over S
Transaction result retention is O(K),
not constant memory.
Remaining holdings also need a read plan.
end note
@enduml
